ge and with obvious emulation of imperial practices, based primarily on the account of Theodoret of Cyrrhus.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
